## Current IDoc Handlers

### Plant Hierarchy Ingestion

| Handler | Decorator | Family | Version | Configs (evaluated in order) | Persistence |
|---------|-----------|--------|---------|------------------------------|-------------|
| `LoiwcsHandler` | `@idocHandler(IDOC_FAMILY.loiwcs)` | LOIWCS | generic | `LOIWCS_V3_CONFIG` → `LOIWCS_V2_CONFIG` | `LoiwcsEquipmentService.upsertEquipment()` → `isa95.equipment` + related tables |
| `LoirnhHandler` | `@idocHandler(IDOC_FAMILY.loirnh)` | LOIRNH | generic | `LOIRNH_V1_DIRECT_CONFIG` → `LOIRNH_V1_WRAPPED_CONFIG` | `LoirnhHierarchyService.linkHierarchy()` → `isa95.equipment.parent_equipment_id` |

